# The two-ended loops of the domains, `pair_for (directed, atomic)` over the
# rows of a matrix (D290), with the table of a block for their values at
# the neighbors and at the centers (`pair-hash=on`, D[scatter-op]): the
# program of dist-eam-exec.mlir on a GPU, 3x2x1 domains in the derivative's
# form on the directed traversal, in double and mixed precision, against
# its references, as GPU/dist-eam-exec.mlir runs it with the atomics.
#
# REQUIRES: cuda
#
# RUN: sed 's/GRID/3, 2, 1/; s/TOLERANCE/1.0e-10/' %S/dist-eam-exec.mlir \
# RUN: | mdir-opt --md-distribute="grid=3,2,1 traversal=directed potentials=eam,linear" \
# RUN:     %md_passes \
# RUN:     --convert-md-dist-to-md-exec="functions=derived,energy,vjp" \
# RUN:     --convert-md-dist-to-loops \
# RUN:     --convert-md-to-md-exec="skin=0.2 width=64" %md_exec_transforms \
# RUN:     --md-exec-choose-scatter=pair-hash=on \
# RUN:     --md-exec-assign-storage=memory=device --convert-md-exec-to-gpu \
# RUN: | mlir-opt %lower_gpu_to_llvm \
# RUN: | mlir-runner -e main --entry-point-result=void \
# RUN:     --shared-libs=%mlir_c_runner_utils,%mdrt,%mdrt_cuda \
# RUN: | FileCheck %S/dist-eam-exec.mlir --check-prefixes=CHECK,DOUBLE
#
# RUN: sed 's/GRID/3, 2, 1/; s/TOLERANCE/1.0e-5/' %S/dist-eam-exec.mlir \
# RUN: | mdir-opt --md-distribute="grid=3,2,1 traversal=directed potentials=eam,linear" \
# RUN:     %md_passes \
# RUN:     --convert-md-dist-to-md-exec="functions=derived,energy,vjp" \
# RUN:     --convert-md-dist-to-loops \
# RUN:     --convert-md-to-md-exec="skin=0.2 width=64" %md_exec_transforms \
# RUN:     --md-exec-assign-precision="mode=mixed" \
# RUN:     --md-exec-choose-scatter=pair-hash=on \
# RUN:     --md-exec-assign-storage=memory=device --convert-md-exec-to-gpu \
# RUN: | mlir-opt %lower_gpu_to_llvm \
# RUN: | mlir-runner -e main --entry-point-result=void \
# RUN:     --shared-libs=%mlir_c_runner_utils,%mdrt,%mdrt_cuda \
# RUN: | FileCheck %S/dist-eam-exec.mlir --check-prefixes=CHECK
#
# The two-ended loops take the table, and their kernels hold it.
# RUN: sed 's/GRID/3, 2, 1/; s/TOLERANCE/1.0e-10/' %S/dist-eam-exec.mlir \
# RUN: | mdir-opt --md-distribute="grid=3,2,1 traversal=directed potentials=eam,linear" \
# RUN:     %md_passes \
# RUN:     --convert-md-dist-to-md-exec="functions=derived,energy,vjp" \
# RUN:     --convert-md-dist-to-loops \
# RUN:     --convert-md-to-md-exec="skin=0.2 width=64" %md_exec_transforms \
# RUN:     --md-exec-choose-scatter=pair-hash=on \
# RUN: | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=CHOSEN
# CHOSEN: md_exec.pair_for {{.*}} policy(directed, atomic) scatter(hash(512, 8, 0))
